    <item>
      <title>OPT Speckle Structured-Light RGB-D Cameras</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 08 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The speckle structured-light camera family is built around binocular depth sensing with active speckle projection. It is positioned for large field-of-view imaging, synchronized RGB-depth acquisition, and cost-sensitive industrial robot vision where millimeter-level depth is enough but speed and coverage matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















&lt;figure  &gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center	&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;w-100&#34; &gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Speckle product matrix&#34; srcset=&#34;
               /projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/featured_huca66c793b8a2ed26df9399a7c6ab26f9_53572_3ec413623dedb1dcf68f71220efc2e36.webp 400w,
               /projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/featured_huca66c793b8a2ed26df9399a7c6ab26f9_53572_655a8495300f55e9d95863f5ad9d1f01.webp 760w,
               /projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/featured_huca66c793b8a2ed26df9399a7c6ab26f9_53572_1200x1200_fit_q80_h2_lanczos_2.webp 1200w&#34;
               src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/featured_huca66c793b8a2ed26df9399a7c6ab26f9_53572_3ec413623dedb1dcf68f71220efc2e36.webp&#34;
               width=&#34;760&#34;
               height=&#34;428&#34;
               loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;em&gt;LSA1 binocular speckle product series for large field-of-view RGB-D acquisition.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;my-role&#34;&gt;My role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My work connects the RGB-D camera output to the 3D algorithm stack: stereo post-processing, RGB-depth alignment, colored point-cloud generation, robot-vision workflows, and Smart3 deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;principle&#34;&gt;Principle&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The camera projects a speckle pattern onto the scene, captures the deformed pattern from two CMOS sensors, and reconstructs depth through stereo matching and triangulation. The output can include RGB image, depth map, and colored point cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















&lt;figure  &gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center	&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;w-100&#34; &gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Speckle principle&#34; srcset=&#34;
               /projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/speckle-principle_hua13ae330e0eaf409ee540d83d4dd05cb_107774_71f8987386cfbc20aa80753c97cdf957.webp 400w,
               /projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/speckle-principle_hua13ae330e0eaf409ee540d83d4dd05cb_107774_0dfedac1b95d76fe3b980fc0609d4104.webp 760w,
               /projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/speckle-principle_hua13ae330e0eaf409ee540d83d4dd05cb_107774_1200x1200_fit_q80_h2_lanczos_2.webp 1200w&#34;
               src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/speckle-principle_hua13ae330e0eaf409ee540d83d4dd05cb_107774_71f8987386cfbc20aa80753c97cdf957.webp&#34;
               width=&#34;760&#34;
               height=&#34;428&#34;
               loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;em&gt;Active speckle projection and binocular disparity reconstruction.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;product-strengths&#34;&gt;Product strengths&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The product family emphasizes large field-of-view coverage, low cost in wide-area scenarios, RGB image and depth map output from one acquisition, compact body design, high frame rate up to 20 FPS, and anti-ambient-light capability above 30000 lx.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















&lt;figure  &gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center	&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;w-100&#34; &gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;RGB-D alignment&#34; srcset=&#34;
               /projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/rgbd-alignment_hu003858f994e9b56e712c73b51d7e8bbb_100444_aaf49fa7d27c32aefdff80ea05da0c21.webp 400w,
               /projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/rgbd-alignment_hu003858f994e9b56e712c73b51d7e8bbb_100444_d672f024a2b301ce27c402d8275a58c6.webp 760w,
               /projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/rgbd-alignment_hu003858f994e9b56e712c73b51d7e8bbb_100444_1200x1200_fit_q80_h2_lanczos_2.webp 1200w&#34;
               src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/rgbd-alignment_hu003858f994e9b56e712c73b51d7e8bbb_100444_aaf49fa7d27c32aefdff80ea05da0c21.webp&#34;
               width=&#34;760&#34;
               height=&#34;428&#34;
               loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;em&gt;Depth and RGB are aligned for colored point-cloud output and recognition-driven measurement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;stereo-algorithms&#34;&gt;Stereo algorithms&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The RGB-D algorithm stack uses stereo rectification, cost computation, cost aggregation, disparity estimation, subpixel refinement, flying-point removal, consistency checks, uniqueness checks, smoothing, and 2D/3D coordinate alignment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















&lt;figure  &gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center	&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;w-100&#34; &gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Stereo algorithm upgrade&#34; srcset=&#34;
               /projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/stereo-upgrade_hu0b1b45860f60d955991327c2eb490006_128160_c33004b15f58a3275e108e51e17c9732.webp 400w,
               /projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/stereo-upgrade_hu0b1b45860f60d955991327c2eb490006_128160_5cc812fd1e1f5e89fc5863831812f19c.webp 760w,
               /projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/stereo-upgrade_hu0b1b45860f60d955991327c2eb490006_128160_1200x1200_fit_q80_h2_lanczos_2.webp 1200w&#34;
               src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/projects/opt-3d-speckle-rgbd-cameras/stereo-upgrade_hu0b1b45860f60d955991327c2eb490006_128160_c33004b15f58a3275e108e51e17c9732.webp&#34;
               width=&#34;760&#34;
               height=&#34;428&#34;
               loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;em&gt;Stereo matching and post-processing improve edge reconstruction and flying-point removal.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;applications&#34;&gt;Applications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Primary applications include logistics bin picking, dynamic parcel sorting, depalletizing, large-format volume measurement, PACK packaging, sheet-metal cutting localization, and robot obstacle-aware guidance. Logistics cases benefit from large field of view, fast point-cloud output, RGB-assisted AI recognition, and high-throughput picking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















